="00:32.220" end="00:33.030">started </span><span begin="00:33.030" end="00:33.060">（</span><span begin="00:33.060" end="00:33.840">What</span><span begin="00:33.840" end="00:34.030">?</span><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:34.230">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.230" end="00:36.840"><span begin="00:34.230" end="00:34.440">Got </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.530">me </span><span begin="00:34.530" end="00:34.830">thinkin' </span><span begin="00:34.830" end="00:35.070">so </span><span begin="00:35.070" end="00:35.370">deep</span><span begin="00:35.370" end="00:35.370">, </span><span begin="00:35.370" end="00:35.460">know </span><span begin="00:35.460" end="00:35.580">I'm </span><span begin="00:35.580" end="00:35.730">in </span><span begin="00:35.730" end="00:35.940">my </span><span begin="00:35.940" end="00:36.840">conscious</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.950" end="00:41.670"><span begin="00:37.950" end="00:38.160">Got </span><span begin="00:38.160" end="00:38.280">me </span><span begin="00:38.280" end="00:38.580">doin' </span><span begin="00:38.580" end="00:38.790">these </span><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:39.090">drugs</span><span begin="00:39.090" end="00:39.090">, </span><span begin="00:39.090" end="00:39.240">it </span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.450">help </span><span begin="00:39.450" end="00:39.660">me </span><span begin="00:39.660" end="00:40.080">balanced </span><span begin="00:40.080" end="00:40.080">（</span><span begin="00:40.080" end="00:40.380">Shawty</span><span begin="00:40.380" end="00:40.380">, </span><span begin="00:40.380" end="00:40.530">I'm </span><span begin="00:40.530" end="00:41.040">geeked</span><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.040">, </span><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.400">yeah</span><span begin="00:41.400" end="00:41.670">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.670" end="00:44.190"><span begin="00:41.670" end="00:41.790">I </span><span begin="00:41.790" end="00:41.970">ain't </span><span begin="00:41.970" end="00:42.180">tryna </span><span begin="00:42.180" end="00:42.420">blame </span><span begin="00:42.420" end="00:42.630">you </span><span begin="00:42.630" end="00:42.840">but </span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:42.990">this </span><span begin="00:42.990" end="00:43.200">shit </span><span begin="00:43.200" end="00:43.260">a </span><span begin="00:43.260" end="00:44.190">challenge</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.420" end="00:47.910"><span begin="00:45.420" end="00:45.600">I </span><span begin="00:45.600" end="00:45.870">live </span><span begin="00:45.870" end="00:46.050">my </span><span begin="00:46.050" end="00:46.320">life </span><span begin="00:46.320" end="00:46.470">like </span><span begin="00:46.470" end="00:46.530">a </span><span begin="00:46.530" end="00:46.800">king </span><span begin="00:46.800" end="00:46.950">with </span><span begin="00:46.950" end="00:47.010">an </span><span begin="00:47.010" end="00:47.910">allowance</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.020" end="00:52.740"><span begin="00:49.020" end="00:49.290">My </span><span begin="00:49.290" end="00:49.500">life </span><span begin="00:49.500" end="00:49.710">so </span><span begin="00:49.710" end="00:50.040">fast</span><span begin="00:50.040" end="00:50.070">, </span><span begin="00:50.070" end="00:50.190">I </span><span begin="00:50.190" end="00:50.400">need </span><span begin="00:50.400" end="00:50.550">me </span><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:50.640">a </span><span begin="00:50.640" end="00:50.940">dime </span><span begin="00:50.940" end="00:51.030">*</span><span begin="00:51.030" end="00:51.120">*</span><span begin="00:51.120" end="00:51.210">*</span><span begin="00:51.210" end="00:51.300">*</span><span begin="00:51.300" end="00:51.390">* </span><span begin="00:51.390" end="00:51.510">（</span><span begin="00:51.510" end="00:52.020">Fast</span><span begin="00:52.020" end="00:52.050">, </span><span begin="00:52.050" end="00:52.260">hold </span><span begin="00:52.260" end="00:52.440">on</span><span begin="00:52.440" end="00:52.740">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.740" end="00:55.080"><span begin="00:52.740" end="00:53.100">And </span><span begin="00:53.100" end="00:53.220">I </span><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.460">keep </span><span begin="00:53.460" end="00:53.940">tatted </span><span begin="00:53.940" end="00:54.150">under </span><span begin="00:54.150" end="00:54.510">my </span><span begin="00:54.510" end="00:55.080">armpits</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.400" end="00:59.190"><span begin="00:56.400" end="00:56.730">Don't </span><span begin="00:56.730" end="00:56.970">make </span><span begin="00:56.970" end="00:57.120">me </span><span begin="00:57.120" end="00:57.540">start </span><span begin="00:57.540" end="00:57.630">a </span><span begin="00:57.630" end="00:57.710">*</span><span begin="00:57.710" end="00:57.790">*</span><span begin="00:57.790" end="00:57.870">*</span><span begin="00:57.870" end="00:57.960">*</span><span begin="00:57.960" end="00:58.110">in' </span><span begin="00:58.110" end="00:59.190">riot</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.150" end="01:03.840"><span begin="01:00.150" end="01:00.750">Sometimes</span><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:00.750">, </span><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:00.900">this </span><span begin="01:00.900" end="01:01.170">shit </span><span begin="01:01.170" end="01:01.350">be </span><span begin="01:01.350" end="01:01.650">so </span><span begin="01:01.650" end="01:02.670">excitin' </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:02.670">（</span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.300">What</span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.540">? </span><span begin="01:03.540" end="01:03.840">What</span><span begin="01:03.840" end="01:03.840">?</span><span begin="01:03.840" end="01:03.840">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.840" end="01:06.330"><span begin="01:03.840" end="01:04.080">We </span><span begin="01:04.080" end="01:04.530">ridin' </span><span begin="01:04.530" end="01:04.800">'round</span><span begin="01:04.800" end="01:04.800">, </span><span begin="01:04.800" end="01:04.950">we </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.490">startin' </span><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:06.330">riots</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.560" end="01:11.190"><span begin="01:07.560" end="01:07.770">We </span><span begin="01:07.770" end="01:08.070">rob </span><span begin="01:08.070" end="01:08.220">the </span><span begin="01:08.220" end="01:08.490">bank </span><span begin="01:08.490" end="01:08.730">'cause </span><span begin="01:08.730" end="01:08.910">we </span><span begin="01:08.910" end="01:09.180">want </span><span begin="01:09.180" end="01:10.050">profits </span><span begin="01:10.050" end="01:10.050">（</span><span begin="01:10.050" end="01:10.770">Damn</span><span begin="01:10.770" end="01:11.190">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.190" end="01:14.940"><span begin="01:11.190" end="01:11.460">We </span><span begin="01:11.460" end="01:11.760">took </span><span begin="01:11.760" end="01:11.910">our </span><span begin="01:11.910" end="01:12.210">shit </span><span begin="01:12.210" end="01:12.360">and </span><span begin="01:12.360" end="01:12.720">kept </span><span begin="01:12.720" end="01:12.840">it </span><span begin="01:12.840" end="01:13.350">silent </span><span begin="01:13.350" end="01:13.350">（</span><span begin="01:13.350" end="01:13.710">What</span><span begin="01:13.710" end="01:13.740">? </span><span begin="01:13.740" end="01:14.580">What</span><span begin="01:14.580" end="01:14.640">? </span><span begin="01:14.640" end="01:14.940">What</span><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:14.940">?</span><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:14.940">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.940" end="01:18.480"><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:15.150">We </span><span begin="01:15.150" end="01:15.390">took </span><span begin="01:15.390" end="01:15.630">that </span><span begin="01:15.630" end="01:15.870">route </span><span begin="01:15.870" end="01:16.080">'cause </span><span begin="01:16.080" end="01:16.380">we </span><span begin="01:16.380" end="01:16.890">about </span><span begin="01:16.890" end="01:17.940">it </span><span begin="01:17.940" end="01:17.940">（</span><span begin="01:17.940" end="01:18.300">Yeah</span><span begin="01:18.300" end="01:18.480">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.480" end="01:22.200"><span begin="01:18.480" end="01:18.750">Say </span><span begin="01:18.750" end="01:18.870">you </span><span begin="01:18.870" end="01:19.230">catchin' </span><span begin="01:19.230" end="01:19.320">them </span><span begin="01:19.320" end="01:19.740">bodies</span><span begin="01:19.740" end="01:19.740">, </span><span begin="01:19.740" end="01:19.830">I </span><span begin="01:19.830" end="01:20.280">highly </span><span begin="01:20.280" end="01:20.610">doubt </span><span begin="01:20.610" end="01:20.730">it </span><span begin="01:20.730" end="01:20.730">（</span><span begin="01:20.730" end="01:20.970">Catchin' </span><span begin="01:20.970" end="01:21.090">no </span><span begin="01:21.090" end="01:21.540">bodies</span><span begin="01:21.540" end="01:21.990">, </span><span begin="01:21.990" end="01:22.200">yeah</span><span begin="01:22.200" end="01:22.200">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.200" end="01:26.010"><span begin="01:22.200" end="01:22.320">My </span><span begin="01:22.320" end="01:22.500">boys </span><span begin="01:22.500" end="01:22.800">shot </span><span begin="01:22.800" end="01:22.920">at </span><span begin="01:22.920" end="01:23.040">them </span><span begin="01:23.040" end="01:23.340">niggas </span><span begin="01:23.340" end="01:23.430">and </span><span begin="01:23.430" end="01:23.520">they </span><span begin="01:23.520" end="01:23.820">rollin' </span><span begin="01:23.820" end="01:23.970">off </span><span begin="01:23.970" end="01:24.390">molly </span><span begin="01:24.390" end="01:24.390">（</span><span begin="01:24.390" end="01:24.720">Catchin' </span><